    "description": "The Handoff Submission API enables seamless integration and coordination of banking sessions by facilitating the creation of handoff specifications. This endpoint is designed for financial service providers and developers to manage the transfer of session-related data effectively. By submitting a handoff, clients can ensure that essential information is accurately communicated between systems during banking operations. Typical consumers of this API include developers working on banking applications and institutions aiming to enhance their customer service through optimized session management.",
